From fceb97debb950b94df220c9963ccced4ad31fa2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ronny Stiftel <ronny.stiftel@tomcom.de>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:34:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Bound invasion Echoes policy to supported character levels

Pay Insight only below level 10 and above 544; retain the documented explicit
Echoes policy for supported levels, including level 10's 487-cost fixture. Keep
integer arithmetic and never substitute a guessed negative/low-level cost.
Correct the local deployment recipe to the live /docker/docker-compose.yml path.

Validation: isolated opc ARM64 Docker build and all 10 focused CTest suites pass,
including reward grant isolation, durable solo mailbox resumes/counters and the
new low-level policy fixtures. No service replacement or restart performed.

Original-author: Kaniel / lKaniel (original invasion and co-op design/source)
Original-author: Vitalii Shevchuk (original source history)
Original-author: shadNet Project contributors (original SPDX copyright holders)
