diff --git a/docs/INVASIONS.md b/docs/INVASIONS.md
index 79c6b93e..1663aeab 100644
--- a/docs/INVASIONS.md
+++ b/docs/INVASIONS.md
@@ -168,8 +168,8 @@ turning invasions off never pays. Guests do not get the host's defending reward.
 The payment is one Insight, plus Blood Echoes according to the explicit server policy in
 `InvasionVictoryEchoes`: 10% for an invading winner, 30% for a defending host, of
 `max(0, floor(0.02 L^3 + 3.06 L^2 + 105.6 L - 895))`. The defeated hunter's level is frozen at
-match (invader) or join (host); a death report cannot increase it. Unknown/out-of-range levels
-(outside 4..544) pay no Echoes. The polynomial is a **server policy**, not a claim that every
+match (invader) or join (host); a death report cannot increase it. Unsupported low levels and unknown/out-of-range levels
+(outside 10..544) pay no Echoes. The polynomial is a **server policy**, not a claim that every
 low-level or covenant-specific retail reward has been verified. Native game validation and
 low-level curve verification are recorded separately by the consuming Mac client.
 
diff --git a/docs/INVASION_REWARDS_DEPLOYMENT.md b/docs/INVASION_REWARDS_DEPLOYMENT.md
index 1323502c..64c8b8e8 100644
--- a/docs/INVASION_REWARDS_DEPLOYMENT.md
+++ b/docs/INVASION_REWARDS_DEPLOYMENT.md
@@ -43,7 +43,7 @@ identity's forged ACK, server-only item/refund rejection and malformed grant val
 ## Service replacement and validation
 
 Before replacing the service, record its current compose service name, image reference and
-health status. Save an exact copy of `/docker/docker-compose.yaml`. Update only the Bloodborne
+health status. Save an exact copy of `/docker/docker-compose.yml`. Update only the Bloodborne
 image value to the new image, then recreate only that service with its existing volumes and
 configuration; no volume removal or account reset is required. Preserve the previous image and
 compose copy for rollback. Test capable and original clients, then verify the service is healthy.
